  "title": "Liver Pâté",
  "description": "This liver pâté recipe is easy to make in a food processor with chicken livers, sherry, and spices for a silky smooth spread that&#39;s delicious on bread.",
  "authors": [
    "William Uncle Bill Anatooskin"
  ],
